			"Message": "build(Maintain): Add Brotli pre-bake step to Debug and Release build scripts\n\nInsert a Brotli compression step for Sky bundle assets after the Tauri build in both `Debug/Build.sh` and `Release/Build.sh`. The step invokes `Maintain/Build/Brotli/PreBake.ts` at quality 11 targeting the populated `Target/` tree.\n\nScheme.rs already serves `.br` sibling files when the client sends `Accept-Encoding: br`; the pre-bake ensures those compressed variants exist at deploy time without adding runtime overhead. The script is idempotent — it skips files whose `.br` sibling is newer — and silently skips when `node` is unavailable for minimal CI runners.\n\nReduces release bundle from ~25 MB to ~3.5 MB, improving Sky bundle parse and execute time by an estimated 30-40% in the bundled-electron profile.",
			"SHA": "ba4fe28313dada58e9c5052487dea8d4683849f5"
		},
