				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				129,
				1
			],
			"Message": "chore(Element): Advance with Cocoon and Wind IPC contract updates\n\nUpdate the Element submodule to commit 77ab17dd, incorporating critical architectural refinements from the Cocoon and Wind submodules to strengthen the gRPC and Tauri IPC boundaries.\n\nThe Cocoon update (bf9d9ffa) introduces `Types.ts` under `Source/Services/Mountain/gRPC` to formalize the contract between the extension host and native backend. It defines strict DTOs (e.g., `ShowTextDocumentOptions`, `TextEdit`) and the `IMountainGRPCClientService` interface, enabling strong typing for native operations without importing the full Effect-TS runtime.\n\nThe Wind update (a25a3c5b) adds `MountainCommands.ts` and `Converters.ts` to centralize file-system IPC method strings (e.g., `file:stat`, `file:readdir`) and implement pure conversion logic between VS Code URI shapes and Mountain's raw JSON responses. This isolates protocol mapping from core services, facilitating unit testing and ensuring synchronization with native handlers.\n\nThese changes enforce separation of concerns and type safety across the editor stack as the IPC architecture matures.",
			"SHA": "6c3de8c28bf007f6c0bcbb420dec0c6f3423c44e"
		}
